    <string name="source_info">SFW wallpapers from Wallhaven. Images belong to their respective owners.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Walper works in guest mode without an account or backend. Favorites, download metadata, search history, activity history and settings are stored on this device. Android backups are disabled for this app.\n\nSearch requests, chosen filters and image requests are sent directly to Wallhaven over HTTPS. Wallhaven receives normal connection information such as your IP address. Images remain the property of their owners; check the original source before reusing them.\n\nDownloads are saved in Pictures/Walper. On Android 9 and earlier, storage permission is required to save them. Walper does not scan your photo library. Wallpaper permission is used only after you select a target, or enable automatic changes from your downloads.\n\nSystem notifications are optional. Automatic wallpaper changes use Android background scheduling and may be delayed.\n\nIssue reports contain only the fields you enter and basic app/device information displayed in the preview. Reports are shared through Android Sharesheet; there is no support server or automatic submission.</string>
